[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4628.11, "timestamp": "01:17:08", "text": "我该扔掉吗？我甚至都无法启动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4633.62, "timestamp": "01:17:13", "text": "菜单。至少我还活着。我很高兴。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4638.91, "timestamp": "01:17:18", "text": "居住。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4651.11, "timestamp": "01:17:31", "text": "你好。呃，还在加载中。它不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4655.43, "timestamp": "01:17:35", "text": "甚至正在加载。这辆车，回到我身边来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4657.39, "timestamp": "01:17:37", "text": "它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4660.87, "timestamp": "01:17:40", "text": "好的。我甚至都打不开那些东西，也无法杀死它们。"}]